  "held": [
    "HEAD matches the requested commit. All specified source and test files were read. Rscript tests/testthat.R exited successfully across all six test files.",
    "Demo overlays were visually inspected. Tip/base markers lie on their contours within 5.69e-14 pixels and match the declared left direction. Fixed-threshold crop coordinates agree exactly.",
    "Independent Fourier quadrature agrees within 3.15e-11. Rolled Momocs input agrees within 5.86e-17; unrolled input differs by 0.00258335. The phase adjustment is valid.",
    "GPA agrees with the geomorph fixture within 1.28e-6 after one common rotation. Final rotation is consistent, and the reflection guard preserves shape.",
    "Ordinary resampling, measurements, symmetrization, silhouette, region partition, RV trace formula, and RNG restoration checks pass, subject to the reported edge cases.",
    "Working/original scale conversion and saved scale units are correct. Sharing unchecked prevents ordinary cross-image fallback. Analysis settings preserve saved specimens.",
    "Normal CSV round trips, merge branching, sample-size guards, k clamping, and demo downloads work on the tested fixtures.",
